# Distributions to build the xrdp preview for (./build-xrdp.sh --preview).
# The GNOME backend needs libei and Mutter's ConnectToEIS (GNOME 46 and
# newer), so Debian 12 (GNOME 43) is not here.
# Marks after the image (any number, then a note) leave out a feature the
# release cannot give the preview:
# "no-sway": the release's sway is older than 1.11 (wlroots 0.19), whose
# screen capture protocols (ext-image-copy-capture) the wlroots backend
# needs; its packages work for Xorg sessions, and the test skips sway.
# "no-av1": the release has no libaom 3.0 or newer (deps/*-preview.txt),
# which xrdp's AV1 encoder needs; it is built without AV1, and clients
# get H.264 instead. ./check-deps.sh --preview shows which release needs it.
debian:testing
debian:13       no-sway   sway 1.10
ubuntu:26.10
ubuntu:26.04
ubuntu:24.04    no-sway   sway 1.9
fedora:45
fedora:44
fedora:43
